1
00:00:01,106 --> 00:00:03,442
[♪ pop music playing]

2
00:00:45,359 --> 00:00:49,071
PERFECT CROWN

3
00:00:59,956 --> 00:01:01,083
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION

4
00:01:01,166 --> 00:01:03,085
CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
WERE FILMED SAFELY

5
00:01:04,086 --> 00:01:06,088
[♪ tender music plays]

6
00:01:18,475 --> 00:01:20,310
[I-AN] You said you'd let me fly.

7
00:01:20,394 --> 00:01:21,812
Why are you the one flying?

8
00:01:23,522 --> 00:01:25,524
Let's switch. I can hold you.

9
00:01:26,274 --> 00:01:27,776
-Forget it.
-Why not? Come on…

10
00:01:27,859 --> 00:01:29,236
[yelps]

11
00:01:29,820 --> 00:01:31,738
-[grunts]
-[Huiju yelps]

12
00:01:31,822 --> 00:01:33,073
[Huiju pants]

13
00:01:35,283 --> 00:01:37,202
[distorted breath]

14
00:01:37,285 --> 00:01:38,787
[distorted exhale]

15
00:01:38,870 --> 00:01:40,122
[Huiju grunts]

16
00:01:42,499 --> 00:01:43,583
[gasps]

17
00:01:46,169 --> 00:01:48,171
[♪ gentle pop music plays]

18
00:01:52,008 --> 00:01:53,260
Your Royal Highness.

19
00:01:53,927 --> 00:01:55,387
Are you hurt anywhere?

20
00:02:02,310 --> 00:02:03,812
You said I can do whatever I want.

21
00:03:19,012 --> 00:03:24,017
PERFECT CROWN

22
00:03:24,601 --> 00:03:26,144
EPISODE 7

23
00:03:28,939 --> 00:03:29,940
[I-AN clears throat]

24
00:03:40,742 --> 00:03:42,744
-[Youngseon] Your Ladyship!
-[Yeongmun] Your Royal Highness.

25
00:03:43,703 --> 00:03:47,040
Why were you out so late
without the Royal Guard?

26
00:03:48,333 --> 00:03:50,460
Well, we were… You know…

27
00:03:50,544 --> 00:03:53,421
They must have wanted some alone time.
STYLE
::cue()

28
00:03:53,505 --> 00:03:55,131
[Youngseon chuckles]

29
00:03:55,215 --> 00:03:57,217
Did you go somewhere nice?

30
00:03:57,300 --> 00:03:58,718
-No!
-No!

31
00:04:02,764 --> 00:04:03,890
[sighs]

32
00:04:04,849 --> 00:04:06,726
He wanted some fresh air,

33
00:04:07,811 --> 00:04:09,896
so we went for a drive. Beep-beep.

34
00:04:10,438 --> 00:04:12,774
Then you should've let us know!

35
00:04:12,857 --> 00:04:15,819
Aide Choi is a complete mess
because you two weren't reachable.

36
00:04:15,902 --> 00:04:16,903
[clears throat]

37
00:04:21,741 --> 00:04:22,742
Listen.

38
00:04:23,869 --> 00:04:25,161
-You should…
-Pardon?

39
00:04:25,245 --> 00:04:27,080
-What? Huh?
-Yes?

40
00:04:31,835 --> 00:04:33,128
You should get some rest.

41
00:04:33,211 --> 00:04:34,421
[♪ playful music playing]

42
00:04:34,504 --> 00:04:35,797
Aren't you tired?

43
00:04:37,215 --> 00:04:38,550
I am.

44
00:04:40,385 --> 00:04:41,803
Gosh, I'm so tired.

45
00:05:00,822 --> 00:05:02,824
[♪ gentle music plays]

46
00:05:08,038 --> 00:05:09,497
[exclaims quietly]

47
00:05:09,581 --> 00:05:10,665
[sighs]

48
00:05:21,468 --> 00:05:23,011
[muffled exclaiming]

49
00:05:25,472 --> 00:05:26,556
[pants]

50
00:05:27,766 --> 00:05:29,768
I mean, it's no big deal.

51
00:05:29,851 --> 00:05:32,020
We were just caught up in the moment.

52
00:05:32,103 --> 00:05:33,396
I mean, it's not like

53
00:05:33,980 --> 00:05:35,148
I threw myself at him.

54
00:05:35,941 --> 00:05:36,942
Hmm.

55
00:05:39,069 --> 00:05:40,904
[sighs]

56
00:05:42,906 --> 00:05:43,990
[whimpers]

57
00:05:44,908 --> 00:05:46,660
[squeakily] Why did I do that?

58
00:06:06,346 --> 00:06:07,347
[gasps]

59
00:06:12,811 --> 00:06:13,937
[chuckles softly]

60
00:06:33,623 --> 00:06:34,749
It's fine.

61
00:06:34,833 --> 00:06:36,793
You're a grown,
functioning member of society.

62
00:06:36,876 --> 00:06:38,128
[chuckles]

63
00:06:38,211 --> 00:06:40,046
It's not fine at all!

64
00:06:40,130 --> 00:06:43,049
I'm so screwed. What am I going to do now?

65
00:06:43,133 --> 00:06:44,759
[footsteps outside]

66
00:06:52,517 --> 00:06:53,643
[I-AN clears throat]

67
00:06:54,769 --> 00:06:55,770
Seong Huiju.

68
00:06:58,231 --> 00:06:59,274
[whispers] What now?

69
00:07:11,411 --> 00:07:12,412
[chuckles softly]

70
00:07:15,999 --> 00:07:17,000
[chuckles softly]

71
00:07:26,509 --> 00:07:28,136
[sighs]

72
00:07:34,642 --> 00:07:36,060
[heartbeat thumping]

73
00:07:36,144 --> 00:07:38,062
Are you nuts? Why are you racing?

74
00:07:38,146 --> 00:07:39,230
[clicks tongue]

75
00:07:41,608 --> 00:07:42,942
[sighs]
STYLE
::cue()

76
00:07:55,288 --> 00:07:56,289
What are you doing?

77
00:07:56,372 --> 00:07:58,249
[yelps]

78
00:08:00,001 --> 00:08:02,003
[♪ dreamy music playing]

79
00:08:19,562 --> 00:08:20,688
Off to work already?

80
00:08:24,317 --> 00:08:25,151
Oh!

81
00:08:25,235 --> 00:08:27,153
[chuckling] Yes, that's right.

82
00:08:27,237 --> 00:08:29,489
I need to get to work.

83
00:08:29,572 --> 00:08:31,908
I need to work. I'm the CEO.

84
00:08:31,991 --> 00:08:34,869
Need to figure out my successor and all.
This and that.

85
00:08:35,703 --> 00:08:37,205
What a lovely day it is today.

86
00:08:37,288 --> 00:08:38,373
See you.

87
00:08:49,300 --> 00:08:50,510
[chuckles]

88
00:08:53,555 --> 00:08:54,597
[church bell tolls]

89
00:08:54,681 --> 00:08:56,558
[♪ organ music plays]

90
00:09:01,271 --> 00:09:04,983
In the name of the Father,
the Son, and the Holy Spirit,

91
00:09:05,066 --> 00:09:06,192
Amen.

92
00:09:06,776 --> 00:09:07,777
Amen.

93
00:09:08,361 --> 00:09:10,071
[chuckles]

94
00:09:10,155 --> 00:09:11,156
You see,

95
00:09:12,031 --> 00:09:14,784
I'm actually not Catholic. Is that okay?

96
00:09:15,660 --> 00:09:18,163
Well, the man upstairs is a forgiving one.

97
00:09:18,746 --> 00:09:19,747
Please go ahead.

98
00:09:19,831 --> 00:09:21,249
[sighs]

99
00:09:21,749 --> 00:09:23,334
Then, by chance,

100
00:09:23,418 --> 00:09:25,461
do you think I could get an exorcism?

101
00:09:25,545 --> 00:09:26,462
Pardon me?

102
00:09:27,839 --> 00:09:28,840
It's just that…

103
00:09:29,591 --> 00:09:31,634
I feel like I'm possessed right now.

104
00:09:36,389 --> 00:09:38,099
[whimpering]

105
00:09:38,183 --> 00:09:39,434
Oh no!

106
00:09:40,602 --> 00:09:43,021
Could we maybe work something out?

107
00:09:43,104 --> 00:09:45,857
I can make a very generous donation
to the church.

108
00:09:46,649 --> 00:09:47,942
[gasps]

109
00:09:49,402 --> 00:09:50,570
[whimpers]

110
00:09:52,155 --> 00:09:53,156
[Huiju] Seriously?

111
00:09:53,656 --> 00:09:55,200
"Not one to begrudge"?

112
00:09:55,283 --> 00:09:57,202
Yet he just did that.

113
00:09:57,702 --> 00:09:59,204
I even wore white for this.

114
00:10:01,748 --> 00:10:02,665
Seong Huiju?

115
00:10:02,749 --> 00:10:04,209
Oh.

116
00:10:04,292 --> 00:10:05,376
Jeongwoo.

117
00:10:05,460 --> 00:10:07,003
[chuckles softly]

118
00:10:07,086 --> 00:10:08,213
What brings you here?

119
00:10:09,380 --> 00:10:10,381
Oh, a cab.

120
00:10:10,465 --> 00:10:12,091
[chuckles]

121
00:10:12,175 --> 00:10:14,636
That's not what I'm asking.
Why are you here?

122
00:10:15,678 --> 00:10:17,305
I thought you weren't religious.

123
00:10:19,182 --> 00:10:20,225
I know, right?

124
00:10:23,561 --> 00:10:24,938
Wait here. I'll be right out.

125
00:10:25,730 --> 00:10:26,981
No, I can just go

126
00:10:27,607 --> 00:10:28,608
by myself…

127
00:10:32,403 --> 00:10:33,988
[sighs]

128
00:10:34,072 --> 00:10:35,698
[phone buzzing]

129
00:10:37,033 --> 00:10:38,743
PRINCE

130
00:10:41,746 --> 00:10:42,956
[clears throat]

131
00:10:43,915 --> 00:10:46,000
[vocalizes]

132
00:10:46,084 --> 00:10:47,085
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

133
00:10:47,168 --> 00:10:48,628
Are you free?

134
00:10:49,754 --> 00:10:50,755
Right now?

135
00:10:50,838 --> 00:10:53,299
We have something on the calendar
for wedding planning,

136
00:10:53,383 --> 00:10:54,842
but you said you were busy.

137
00:10:54,926 --> 00:10:55,927
I see.

138
00:10:57,011 --> 00:10:58,012
Shall I reschedule it?

139
00:10:58,096 --> 00:10:59,389
No, I have time.

140
00:10:59,472 --> 00:11:01,182
Let's go, Huiju.

141
00:11:01,266 --> 00:11:02,517
That was quick.
STYLE
::cue()

142
00:11:06,854 --> 00:11:09,607
Your Royal Highness, I'll call you later.

143
00:11:10,900 --> 00:11:11,901
See you later.

144
00:11:14,362 --> 00:11:17,031
JUNIOR ALUM

145
00:11:18,032 --> 00:11:19,284
[sighs]

146
00:11:19,367 --> 00:11:20,743
Shall we?

147
00:11:24,247 --> 00:11:25,415
I'm coming.

148
00:11:37,302 --> 00:11:38,803
[Huiju] I told you,
I could've taken a cab.

149
00:11:40,179 --> 00:11:41,806
It's fine. It's on the way anyway.

150
00:11:46,602 --> 00:11:47,854
[chuckles]

151
00:11:47,937 --> 00:11:49,397
Do you like driving too?

152
00:11:50,398 --> 00:11:51,858
-That's random.
-The Grand Prince

153
00:11:51,941 --> 00:11:53,359
smiles when he drives too.

154
00:11:54,027 --> 00:11:55,361
He says it feels like he's flying.

155
00:11:56,070 --> 00:11:57,947
[chuckles]

156
00:11:58,031 --> 00:12:00,033
He can be so childlike sometimes.

157
00:12:03,870 --> 00:12:05,788
[♪ gentle piano plays]

158
00:12:08,624 --> 00:12:09,959
[sighs]

159
00:12:12,378 --> 00:12:15,965
CASTLE BEAUTY

160
00:12:16,049 --> 00:12:17,467
Bye. Thanks for the ride.

161
00:12:18,593 --> 00:12:20,094
-Huiju.
-Yes?

162
00:12:21,179 --> 00:12:22,597
Don't get too attached.

163
00:12:24,098 --> 00:12:25,266
What?

164
00:12:25,892 --> 00:12:27,685
It'll drive up the divorce settlement.

165
00:12:28,394 --> 00:12:29,979
Be it in money, reputation…

166
00:12:31,939 --> 00:12:32,940
or your heart.

167
00:12:39,280 --> 00:12:40,615
[scoffs]

168
00:12:40,698 --> 00:12:42,575
Do you think I'm an idiot?

169
00:12:43,576 --> 00:12:45,036
-[chuckles softly]
-[scoffs]

170
00:12:45,119 --> 00:12:46,120
Bye.

171
00:13:00,718 --> 00:13:01,761
[sighs]

172
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,643
[scoffs]

173
00:13:08,726 --> 00:13:10,395
Who does he take me for?

174
00:13:10,895 --> 00:13:13,064
Someone who can't distinguish
between business and pleasure?

175
00:13:13,147 --> 00:13:14,148
Seriously?

176
00:13:14,232 --> 00:13:15,441
[scoffs]

177
00:13:17,610 --> 00:13:18,611
[Hyejeong] Ms. Seong.

178
00:13:18,694 --> 00:13:21,280
Pull the affiliate numbers
and line them up by revenue.

179
00:13:22,365 --> 00:13:23,366
Throw this out for me.

180
00:13:23,449 --> 00:13:24,450
[door opens]

181
00:13:30,373 --> 00:13:31,707
[Hyejeong] Why, all of a sudden?

182
00:13:32,291 --> 00:13:34,460
They must all be thrilled
that I'm stepping down.

183
00:13:34,961 --> 00:13:37,672
Planning to slack off
without the revenue-obsessed boss

184
00:13:37,755 --> 00:13:38,965
breathing down their necks.

185
00:13:39,841 --> 00:13:41,634
So you want to whip them into shape?

186
00:13:41,717 --> 00:13:42,969
Yes.

187
00:13:43,052 --> 00:13:44,470
[♪ dramatic music plays]

188
00:13:44,554 --> 00:13:47,890
I'll remind them they'll be
royally screwed if revenue drops.

189
00:13:51,853 --> 00:13:53,396
Okay, I'll get to it now.

190
00:13:53,479 --> 00:13:54,939
Have Seong Taeju meet me there.

191
00:13:55,022 --> 00:13:56,399
The Senior Managing Director?

192
00:13:59,986 --> 00:14:02,280
AUSPICIOUS DATES
FOR GRAND PRINCE I-AN'S WEDDING

193
00:14:04,157 --> 00:14:06,617
These are the dates
the Royal Secretariat and the Cabinet

194
00:14:06,701 --> 00:14:08,661
have proposed
for the Grand Prince's nuptials.

195
00:14:09,412 --> 00:14:10,538
All are auspicious days,

196
00:14:10,621 --> 00:14:13,583
so Your Majesty may select
whichever you see fit.

197
00:14:18,963 --> 00:14:21,841
[announcer] Your Majesty,
Grand Prince I-AN has arrived.

198
00:14:21,924 --> 00:14:23,634
Show him in.
STYLE
::cue()

199
00:14:31,726 --> 00:14:32,727
Your Majesty.

200
00:14:34,896 --> 00:14:37,231
I heard you were selecting
the day for my nuptials.

201
00:14:38,816 --> 00:14:40,651
I am considering choosing this date.

202
00:14:41,152 --> 00:14:42,195
Is there a particular reason?

203
00:14:42,278 --> 00:14:44,739
Is it not the earliest day?

204
00:14:44,822 --> 00:14:45,865
[chuckles softly]

205
00:14:47,283 --> 00:14:48,618
May I take a look?

206
00:14:49,952 --> 00:14:52,121
[♪ pensive music plays]

207
00:14:59,962 --> 00:15:01,881
I would prefer this day.

208
00:15:03,132 --> 00:15:04,717
For any particular reason?

209
00:15:06,761 --> 00:15:07,762
We will need…

210
00:15:09,847 --> 00:15:10,932
some time.

211
00:15:13,684 --> 00:15:15,311
I shall choose this date then.

212
00:15:19,023 --> 00:15:21,984
JULY 3RD, LUNAR JUNE 9TH

213
00:15:26,697 --> 00:15:28,449
[Huiju] I'm just here to support the team.

214
00:15:28,532 --> 00:15:30,493
No need to be nervous.

215
00:15:31,744 --> 00:15:35,414
You are our top-performing affiliate
in terms of sales.

216
00:15:36,958 --> 00:15:38,376
The new collection that just launched

217
00:15:38,459 --> 00:15:41,212
is performing well
with the 25-35 demographic.

218
00:15:41,796 --> 00:15:44,799
This necklace is part of
the same set as your earrings today.

219
00:15:44,882 --> 00:15:46,300
Would you like to try it on?

220
00:15:46,884 --> 00:15:47,885
-Sure.
-All right.

221
00:15:57,144 --> 00:15:58,271
Hmm…

222
00:15:58,354 --> 00:15:59,563
[chuckles]

223
00:16:01,065 --> 00:16:03,901
And it'll stay that way, right?

224
00:16:04,735 --> 00:16:05,736
Pardon?

225
00:16:05,820 --> 00:16:07,363
I don't think I'll ever stop

226
00:16:08,656 --> 00:16:10,074
being curious about numbers.

227
00:16:13,369 --> 00:16:15,371
I might be getting married,

228
00:16:15,913 --> 00:16:18,582
but I'll still be keeping an eye
and ear on things.

229
00:16:19,750 --> 00:16:21,836
Of course, ma'am.
We'll continue doing our best.

230
00:16:21,919 --> 00:16:23,045
[chuckles]

231
00:16:23,879 --> 00:16:25,506
Huiju.

232
00:16:29,677 --> 00:16:31,595
Did I ask you to invite that gremlin too?

233
00:16:31,679 --> 00:16:32,972
It wasn't me.

234
00:16:33,055 --> 00:16:34,140
[Dayeong giggles]

235
00:16:37,601 --> 00:16:39,645
I insisted on coming along.

236
00:16:39,729 --> 00:16:41,439
I missed you, you know.

237
00:16:41,522 --> 00:16:43,983
You could've just called
if you had something to say.

238
00:16:44,066 --> 00:16:45,776
Making me come all this way…
[clicks tongue]

239
00:16:45,860 --> 00:16:48,529
Babe, check this out.
This would look perfect on you.

240
00:16:49,196 --> 00:16:51,324
Come on. This new collection is nice.

241
00:16:51,407 --> 00:16:52,616
Try this on.

242
00:16:53,701 --> 00:16:54,660
It's… Whoa, amazing.

243
00:16:54,744 --> 00:16:56,287
This will be the first handover.

244
00:16:56,370 --> 00:16:57,872
What?

245
00:16:58,789 --> 00:17:00,166
My shares.

246
00:17:01,876 --> 00:17:02,877
Right, your shares…

247
00:17:04,128 --> 00:17:05,254
What?

248
00:17:06,005 --> 00:17:07,006
Wait.

249
00:17:07,089 --> 00:17:08,549
[♪ jazz music plays]

250
00:17:08,632 --> 00:17:10,134
You mean it?

251
00:17:10,217 --> 00:17:12,720
You're really going to hand it over
to me? All of Castle Beauty?

252
00:17:12,803 --> 00:17:14,722
-Should I not?
-You should.

253
00:17:15,556 --> 00:17:18,059
Come on. Why would you say such a thing?

254
00:17:18,142 --> 00:17:20,644
-I will kill you if you fail.
-What?

255
00:17:20,728 --> 00:17:22,313
[scoffs]

256
00:17:22,396 --> 00:17:24,023
You heard me.

257
00:17:24,106 --> 00:17:25,775
[mouthing] I will kill you.

258
00:17:35,034 --> 00:17:38,079
Is that brat setting a trap to murder me?

259
00:17:38,996 --> 00:17:39,997
No.

260
00:17:40,831 --> 00:17:41,707
No?

261
00:17:41,791 --> 00:17:43,793
Yeah, definitely not.
STYLE
::cue()

262
00:17:49,507 --> 00:17:50,633
Did you really mean that?

263
00:17:51,550 --> 00:17:52,551
What?

264
00:17:52,635 --> 00:17:55,388
You have other options,
like hiring a non-owner executive.

265
00:17:55,471 --> 00:17:56,764
There's also Director Choi.

266
00:17:56,847 --> 00:17:58,182
It sounds like

267
00:17:58,974 --> 00:18:01,185
you never want me to come back.

268
00:18:02,645 --> 00:18:06,148
-What?
-Father and everyone will finally get it

269
00:18:06,232 --> 00:18:08,442
once Seong Taeju takes over.

270
00:18:08,526 --> 00:18:09,985
"Oh, right.

271
00:18:10,069 --> 00:18:13,280
Seong Huiju is leagues above Seong Taeju.

272
00:18:13,989 --> 00:18:16,367
Thus, the Castle Group successor must be

273
00:18:16,450 --> 00:18:19,495
Seong Huiju and no one else."

274
00:18:19,578 --> 00:18:20,871
I see.

275
00:18:20,955 --> 00:18:22,540
Which affiliate is next?

276
00:18:28,045 --> 00:18:29,588
Since when were they an affiliate?

277
00:18:30,840 --> 00:18:34,093
I was told you confirmed it.
Were they wrong?

278
00:18:34,176 --> 00:18:35,219
When?

279
00:18:35,302 --> 00:18:36,679
-This morning.
-When did I…

280
00:18:36,762 --> 00:18:38,431
-Are you free?
-I have time.

281
00:18:38,514 --> 00:18:39,515
I did that.

282
00:18:40,683 --> 00:18:41,976
I most certainly did.

283
00:18:42,059 --> 00:18:43,269
Seriously?

284
00:18:43,352 --> 00:18:44,353
Let's go.

285
00:18:46,772 --> 00:18:48,190
[sighs]

286
00:18:48,274 --> 00:18:49,400
[whimpers softly]

287
00:18:51,819 --> 00:18:52,820
What the…

288
00:18:53,571 --> 00:18:54,697
You're unbelievable.

289
00:19:19,430 --> 00:19:20,431
How pretty.

290
00:19:21,390 --> 00:19:23,684
This will be your wedding robe,

291
00:19:23,768 --> 00:19:26,353
so please let us know right away
if you feel any discomfort.

292
00:19:26,437 --> 00:19:27,980
-Sure.
-Please take your place.

293
00:19:32,193 --> 00:19:33,444
Ms. Do.

294
00:20:20,157 --> 00:20:21,867
-Can you turn to the right?
-Sure.

295
00:20:33,254 --> 00:20:34,255
[Huiju] Hmm?

296
00:20:35,130 --> 00:20:36,131
Oh!

297
00:20:36,215 --> 00:20:37,591
What's wrong?

298
00:20:38,676 --> 00:20:39,677
Stay still.

299
00:20:58,362 --> 00:20:59,572
[clears throat]

300
00:21:01,699 --> 00:21:03,367
-[Lady Choi] Are you feeling unwell?
-What?

301
00:21:03,450 --> 00:21:04,827
-[Hyejeong] Are you sick?
-Royal Physician!

302
00:21:04,910 --> 00:21:06,203
-What's wrong?
-No, I'm fine.

303
00:21:06,287 --> 00:21:08,205
-Oh!
-What is it?
STYLE
::cue()

304
00:21:08,289 --> 00:21:10,457
No, I'm just feeling
a little hot. That's all.

305
00:21:10,541 --> 00:21:12,668
No, I think you have a fever.

306
00:21:12,751 --> 00:21:14,837
I'm just a little hot. Too many layers.

307
00:21:14,920 --> 00:21:16,714
Her Ladyship is overheated.
Lower the room temperature.

308
00:21:16,797 --> 00:21:18,007
Yes, ma'am.

309
00:21:18,090 --> 00:21:19,675
-Please hurry.
-No, I…

310
00:21:19,758 --> 00:21:21,176
It will be cooler in no time.

311
00:21:22,177 --> 00:21:24,138
Isn't it time for our next appointment?

312
00:21:24,221 --> 00:21:25,264
[Hyeon] Your next appointment?

313
00:21:25,347 --> 00:21:28,142
After this, a royal physician
will come by for a health assessment.

314
00:21:28,225 --> 00:21:30,394
Tomorrow, we have dinner
at Ms. Seong's family home.

315
00:21:30,477 --> 00:21:32,396
What? "Family home"?

316
00:21:33,272 --> 00:21:35,858
As in my family? Why?

317
00:21:36,442 --> 00:21:39,862
It's customary for a future son-in-law
to offer his greetings to his in-laws.

318
00:21:43,198 --> 00:21:44,199
Mmm.

319
00:21:44,825 --> 00:21:47,620
Ah. The chairman's office was notified.

320
00:21:47,703 --> 00:21:49,121
They already confirmed it.

321
00:21:49,204 --> 00:21:50,331
[Hyeon] Thank you.

322
00:21:50,414 --> 00:21:53,542
I'm off to handle the Marriage Proposal
and Wedding Gift Delivery ceremonies.

323
00:21:54,043 --> 00:21:55,753
Marriage Proposal ceremony?

324
00:21:56,337 --> 00:21:59,798
Marriage Proposal
and Wedding Gift Delivery ceremonies?

325
00:22:01,216 --> 00:22:03,344
[♪ ethereal music plays]

326
00:22:20,569 --> 00:22:23,238
"This is a royal edict
for Hyeonguk of the Seong Family.

327
00:22:23,864 --> 00:22:24,907
The King proclaimed…"

328
00:22:24,990 --> 00:22:27,034
"When Heaven and Earth first parted,

329
00:22:27,117 --> 00:22:28,827
human order came into being.

330
00:22:28,911 --> 00:22:32,456
Through the union of husband and wife,
the ancestors and royal line are upheld."

331
00:22:42,549 --> 00:22:44,134
Hand me another piece of paper.

332
00:22:44,218 --> 00:22:45,260
Yes, Your Majesty.

333
00:22:52,059 --> 00:22:53,811
In accordance with tradition,

334
00:22:53,894 --> 00:22:57,272
Chief Attendant Min Jeongwoo
and Deputy Attendant Choi Hyeon

335
00:22:57,356 --> 00:23:00,442
shall observe proper decorum
and carry out the Marriage Proposal.

336
00:23:00,526 --> 00:23:03,487
[Hyeon] "Thus is the royal edict.
Let all be duly informed."

337
00:23:25,217 --> 00:23:27,428
I will now outline the proceedings.

338
00:23:27,928 --> 00:23:29,263
Traditionally, the wedding rites

339
00:23:29,346 --> 00:23:32,182
begin at the bride's home.

340
00:23:32,266 --> 00:23:34,351
However, given the security risks

341
00:23:34,435 --> 00:23:36,812
and His Royal Highness's regency,
they will instead be held

342
00:23:36,895 --> 00:23:38,355
at his private residence.

343
00:23:39,231 --> 00:23:41,525
Then we'll be
at his private residence as well?

344
00:23:41,608 --> 00:23:43,527
Yes, that's right. [chuckles]

345
00:23:44,361 --> 00:23:47,114
And I also have this for you…

346
00:23:47,197 --> 00:23:49,199
Just a moment.

347
00:23:50,909 --> 00:23:54,246
I put together an outline
of the wedding rites, just in case.

348
00:23:54,329 --> 00:23:55,831
[Hyeonguk] Can you

349
00:23:55,914 --> 00:23:57,416
speak a bit faster?

350
00:23:59,418 --> 00:24:02,129
-Pardon?
-I had to postpone two meetings for this.

351
00:24:03,130 --> 00:24:05,215
Yes, sir. Here you go.

352
00:24:08,927 --> 00:24:10,929
FATHER

353
00:24:13,307 --> 00:24:14,349
Ms. Seong.

354
00:24:15,142 --> 00:24:16,143
Hey.

355
00:24:16,226 --> 00:24:17,770
They're all waiting for you.

356
00:24:20,022 --> 00:24:21,315
[Lady Choi] Why have you stepped outside?

357
00:24:23,776 --> 00:24:24,777
Are you still overheated?

358
00:24:25,694 --> 00:24:27,446
No, it's not that.

359
00:24:27,529 --> 00:24:30,491
Then you must return
for your health assessment.
STYLE
::cue()

360
00:24:32,117 --> 00:24:33,160
Okay.

361
00:24:35,996 --> 00:24:37,372
You will have

362
00:24:37,456 --> 00:24:39,625
a more thorough exam
at Royal Seoul Hospital.

363
00:24:40,292 --> 00:24:43,128
Today's examination will assess
constitution and fertility.

364
00:24:43,212 --> 00:24:44,546
Pardon?

365
00:24:44,630 --> 00:24:45,923
Yes?

366
00:24:48,509 --> 00:24:51,845
Mmm… No, it's nothing. Please continue.

367
00:24:51,929 --> 00:24:55,516
[Lady Choi chuckles]
Heirs are precious within the palace.

368
00:24:55,599 --> 00:24:58,977
Once your health is duly confirmed,
arrangements for your union shall--

369
00:24:59,061 --> 00:25:00,312
"Arrangements"?

370
00:25:02,106 --> 00:25:03,982
What sort of arrangements?

371
00:25:04,942 --> 00:25:08,570
The conjugal union symbolizes
the harmony of yin and yang.

372
00:25:08,654 --> 00:25:12,616
Yin must flow to yang,
and yang must incline toward yin.

373
00:25:12,699 --> 00:25:14,493
Once proper comportment facilitates that,

374
00:25:14,576 --> 00:25:16,328
an auspicious day and hour shall be set…

375
00:25:16,411 --> 00:25:18,122
-[physician] Hold on.
-What is it?

376
00:25:18,705 --> 00:25:20,624
Her pulse is elevated.

377
00:25:21,208 --> 00:25:22,209
Uh…

378
00:25:22,292 --> 00:25:24,086
-Are you feeling unwell?
-[chuckles]

379
00:25:24,169 --> 00:25:25,337
Wait, hold on.

380
00:25:25,420 --> 00:25:27,422
Could this be
a post-accident complication?

381
00:25:27,506 --> 00:25:31,135
[chuckling]
No, it's nothing like that. Be quiet.

382
00:25:31,218 --> 00:25:33,470
[Lady Choi]
Then do you have a preexisting condition?

383
00:25:33,554 --> 00:25:36,723
No, not at all.
No preexisting condition. [chuckles]

384
00:25:36,807 --> 00:25:38,142
[I-AN] That is enough.

385
00:25:38,225 --> 00:25:39,935
I wish to speak with her in private.

386
00:25:40,727 --> 00:25:41,728
Give us the room.

387
00:25:42,646 --> 00:25:44,231
[Lady Choi] Yes, Your Royal Highness.

388
00:25:50,863 --> 00:25:51,864
[Huiju clears throat]

389
00:25:52,948 --> 00:25:54,533
[hums]

390
00:25:54,616 --> 00:25:56,535
[Huiju clears throat]

391
00:25:56,618 --> 00:25:57,828
Something bothering you?

392
00:25:58,453 --> 00:25:59,454
What?

393
00:26:00,747 --> 00:26:02,291
You've been acting strangely.

394
00:26:02,374 --> 00:26:03,584
What do you mean?

395
00:26:07,337 --> 00:26:09,298
You're the one
who's been acting strangely.

396
00:26:10,257 --> 00:26:12,843
-Me?
-You're being unnecessarily sweet to me.

397
00:26:13,552 --> 00:26:15,929
While everyone was watching,

398
00:26:16,013 --> 00:26:17,598
you, like, brushed
the hair out of my face.

399
00:26:17,681 --> 00:26:19,349
And your eyes…

400
00:26:22,603 --> 00:26:26,398
You keep looking at me
with those doe eyes.

401
00:26:26,481 --> 00:26:27,858
My eyes have never changed.

402
00:26:27,941 --> 00:26:28,859
That's not true.

403
00:26:34,156 --> 00:26:35,157
Is this about yesterday?

404
00:26:40,954 --> 00:26:41,955
[shrill grunt]

405
00:26:42,915 --> 00:26:44,166
I'm fine.

406
00:26:44,833 --> 00:26:46,001
About what?

407
00:26:46,084 --> 00:26:47,085
About last night.

408
00:26:48,003 --> 00:26:49,004
[chuckles]

409
00:26:49,087 --> 00:26:50,088
I'm fine with it.

410
00:26:51,215 --> 00:26:53,383
It's not like we're kids or anything.

411
00:26:53,884 --> 00:26:55,260
I mean, if the vibe is right…

412
00:26:56,261 --> 00:26:57,638
Why not?

413
00:26:58,222 --> 00:27:00,390
And with the vibe we had going yesterday,

414
00:27:00,474 --> 00:27:02,476
even if it had been a complete stranger,

415
00:27:03,268 --> 00:27:05,562
anyone would've done the same. Yeah…

416
00:27:10,651 --> 00:27:11,693
A complete stranger…

417
00:27:13,654 --> 00:27:14,655
Pardon?

418
00:27:14,738 --> 00:27:16,073
Not for me.

419
00:27:16,156 --> 00:27:17,950
[♪ gentle music plays]

420
00:27:19,868 --> 00:27:20,869
What?

421
00:27:22,329 --> 00:27:23,413
What does that mean?

422
00:27:24,498 --> 00:27:27,334
I didn't do it just because
I was caught up in the moment.

423
00:27:31,004 --> 00:27:32,005
I did it…

424
00:27:34,466 --> 00:27:35,884
because it's you.
STYLE
::cue()

425
00:27:50,607 --> 00:27:52,484
The Grand Prince is perturbed?

426
00:27:53,026 --> 00:27:54,152
Yes, Your Majesty.

427
00:27:54,236 --> 00:27:56,488
Ms. Seong was by earlier in the day.

428
00:27:56,989 --> 00:27:58,824
He has been a bit agitated ever since.

429
00:28:02,536 --> 00:28:05,747
The date has been set,
yet he remains agitated…

430
00:28:10,043 --> 00:28:11,837
I shall go for a walk with him.

431
00:28:18,927 --> 00:28:20,971
Did something happen to upset you?

432
00:28:25,934 --> 00:28:27,477
You appear troubled.

433
00:28:29,646 --> 00:28:32,441
Could you be upset
about what happened yesterday evening?

434
00:28:34,317 --> 00:28:35,402
Of course not.

435
00:28:37,112 --> 00:28:38,113
Then,

436
00:28:39,364 --> 00:28:41,825
did you have an argument with Ms. Seong?

437
00:28:44,286 --> 00:28:45,996
It seems you wish that to be so.

438
00:28:49,374 --> 00:28:51,168
I am merely worried.

439
00:28:52,210 --> 00:28:54,671
You two come from different worlds.

440
00:28:55,338 --> 00:28:57,549
Perfect accord cannot be easily attained.

441
00:29:02,512 --> 00:29:03,513
And you?

442
00:29:04,848 --> 00:29:06,308
Did you attain accord?

443
00:29:08,894 --> 00:29:10,145
[chuckles]

444
00:29:10,228 --> 00:29:11,396
You and my brother

445
00:29:12,314 --> 00:29:14,524
grew up in the same world.

446
00:29:18,695 --> 00:29:19,696
Did you two…

447
00:29:21,823 --> 00:29:23,075
arrive at happiness?

448
00:29:27,788 --> 00:29:29,664
How can I go by myself?

449
00:29:31,124 --> 00:29:32,918
They are expecting both of us.

450
00:29:33,001 --> 00:29:34,336
What would you have me do?

451
00:29:37,422 --> 00:29:38,423
Your Majesty.

452
00:29:44,137 --> 00:29:45,472
[sighs]

453
00:29:46,890 --> 00:29:48,350
Has my brother run off again?

454
00:29:53,563 --> 00:29:54,564
[clicks tongue]

455
00:29:54,648 --> 00:29:55,857
I shall accompany you.

456
00:29:57,734 --> 00:29:59,945
If we say that the Crown Prince is unwell,

457
00:30:00,570 --> 00:30:03,532
they would scarcely consider it
improper that I, the Grand Prince,

458
00:30:04,199 --> 00:30:05,575
accompany you in his stead.

459
00:30:08,203 --> 00:30:10,163
That would only prompt Father
to reprimand you.

460
00:30:10,247 --> 00:30:11,414
[chuckles]

461
00:30:11,498 --> 00:30:13,834
I'm reprimanded every day anyway.

462
00:30:15,627 --> 00:30:16,670
[chuckles]

463
00:30:17,420 --> 00:30:18,588
[chuckles]

464
00:30:33,895 --> 00:30:35,689
Is there any place

465
00:30:36,857 --> 00:30:39,067
for happiness in a royal union?

466
00:30:57,252 --> 00:30:58,253
[I-AN] I did it

467
00:30:59,379 --> 00:31:00,589
because it's you.

468
00:31:03,884 --> 00:31:05,343
[sighs]

469
00:31:19,983 --> 00:31:23,486
PRINCE

470
00:31:26,156 --> 00:31:27,157
No.

471
00:31:27,657 --> 00:31:29,284
So what?

472
00:31:29,367 --> 00:31:30,744
Should we just date a little

473
00:31:31,786 --> 00:31:33,371
since we're going to divorce anyway?

474
00:31:36,124 --> 00:31:37,125
[in English] Nope.
STYLE
::cue()

475
00:31:49,054 --> 00:31:50,096
[sighs]

476
00:32:00,649 --> 00:32:03,109
MARRIAGE CONTRACT

477
00:32:05,862 --> 00:32:08,907
4. DIVORCE WITHIN THREE YEARS
AT THE LATEST

478
00:32:27,050 --> 00:32:28,635
[♪ dramatic music plays]

479
00:32:28,718 --> 00:32:30,887
[screaming, clamoring]

480
00:32:32,681 --> 00:32:34,057
[Im] You must hurry.

481
00:32:48,154 --> 00:32:49,948
[Yun breathing shakily]

482
00:32:59,916 --> 00:33:01,710
[in Korean] Why are you in such a state?

483
00:33:06,965 --> 00:33:08,758
Please get up, Your Majesty.

484
00:33:15,557 --> 00:33:16,558
Your Majesty?

485
00:33:24,149 --> 00:33:25,150
The press

486
00:33:26,318 --> 00:33:29,112
will soon spread the news
of His Majesty's tragedy.

487
00:33:30,488 --> 00:33:33,908
You must secure
the Crown Prince's accession.

488
00:33:33,992 --> 00:33:36,244
His Majesty had abandoned
the Crown Prince.

489
00:33:40,707 --> 00:33:42,625
He wished to depose the Crown Prince…

490
00:33:46,087 --> 00:33:48,548
and abdicate
in favor of Grand Prince I-AN.

491
00:33:49,716 --> 00:33:50,717
What do you mean?

492
00:33:50,800 --> 00:33:53,261
He even drew up a royal edict!

493
00:33:53,345 --> 00:33:55,138
[breathing shakily]

494
00:34:03,063 --> 00:34:04,105
I am certain…

495
00:34:07,484 --> 00:34:09,152
His Majesty will understand me.

496
00:34:12,739 --> 00:34:14,657
This was all for the Crown Prince's sake.

497
00:34:17,994 --> 00:34:18,995
What in the world

498
00:34:20,413 --> 00:34:22,290
have you done?

499
00:34:25,168 --> 00:34:26,169
I…

500
00:34:31,883 --> 00:34:34,135
I burned it all to the ground.

501
00:34:50,318 --> 00:34:51,319
[sighs]

502
00:35:14,217 --> 00:35:15,760
[safe beeps]

503
00:35:26,354 --> 00:35:29,357
[♪ dramatic music plays]
STYLE
::cue()

504
00:35:46,708 --> 00:35:49,294
AS SUCH, I INTEND TO ABDICATE

505
00:35:49,377 --> 00:35:52,046
AND BE SUCCEEDED
BY GRAND PRINCE I-AN

506
00:35:52,130 --> 00:35:54,132
[♪ epic music playing]

507
00:36:04,726 --> 00:36:07,937
"I am most pleased to see you again,
Your Royal Highness." And then…

508
00:36:08,021 --> 00:36:09,731
"It is my great honor."

509
00:36:10,607 --> 00:36:12,233
-Damn it…
-Babe.

510
00:36:12,317 --> 00:36:13,902
Did you not dry your hair?

511
00:36:13,985 --> 00:36:16,780
I tried doing it like His Royal Highness.
Do you not like it?

512
00:36:16,863 --> 00:36:19,741
Why would you copy his style?

513
00:36:19,824 --> 00:36:22,410
Too many feelers? I just thought…

514
00:36:22,494 --> 00:36:25,205
You're so much more handsome than him!

515
00:36:25,705 --> 00:36:27,123
-Really?
-Who does Taeju belong to?

516
00:36:27,207 --> 00:36:29,626
To Dayeong. Ah…

517
00:36:30,502 --> 00:36:32,796
-Stop it. Come on.
-Why isn't Father coming down?

518
00:36:32,879 --> 00:36:34,672
[clears throat, inhales sharply]

519
00:36:34,756 --> 00:36:37,342
But what if Father
does a repeat of yesterday?

520
00:36:37,425 --> 00:36:38,593
He wouldn't.

521
00:36:38,676 --> 00:36:40,345
Father? Father!

522
00:36:40,428 --> 00:36:41,888
I can hear you perfectly fine.

523
00:36:41,971 --> 00:36:43,306
[clears throat]

524
00:36:43,389 --> 00:36:45,141
Father. [chuckles]

525
00:36:46,392 --> 00:36:49,479
You should lighten up a little.
We should be celebrating today.

526
00:36:49,562 --> 00:36:51,314
-[in English] Smile.
-[in Korean] That's right.

527
00:36:51,397 --> 00:36:53,691
You can hate your own kid,
but you shouldn't hate your son-in-law.

528
00:36:53,775 --> 00:36:55,485
Especially, when he's Grand Prince I-AN.

529
00:36:55,568 --> 00:36:56,569
Just look at me.

530
00:36:56,653 --> 00:37:00,031
After falling for Dayeong,
I bow down to her father like it's my job.

531
00:37:00,114 --> 00:37:02,242
Do you see how Grand Prince I-AN
is wasting no time?

532
00:37:02,325 --> 00:37:04,160
He must be beyond smitten
with her too. I swear--

533
00:37:04,244 --> 00:37:05,829
That's enough of that nonsense.

534
00:37:11,876 --> 00:37:12,877
[huffs]

535
00:37:30,770 --> 00:37:33,398
[Hyeon] If I could just have
your attention for a moment.

536
00:37:33,481 --> 00:37:36,901
Once we arrive, there might be a bit
of a crowd waiting to see you two.

537
00:37:36,985 --> 00:37:39,737
Please remember to smile
when you step out.

538
00:37:39,821 --> 00:37:43,116
Ms. Seong, you can just follow
the Grand Prince's lead and wave.

539
00:37:49,122 --> 00:37:50,123
And the Royal Guard?

540
00:37:50,206 --> 00:37:52,792
We should be fine.
We dispatched double the normal amount.

541
00:37:53,877 --> 00:37:55,086
-What about…
-What about…

542
00:38:01,342 --> 00:38:03,303
Do we have an end time?

543
00:38:03,386 --> 00:38:06,014
There's no rush.
You should just enjoy your meal,

544
00:38:06,097 --> 00:38:08,308
but at the minimum,
we're thinking four hours…

545
00:38:08,391 --> 00:38:09,434
Four hours?

546
00:38:09,517 --> 00:38:11,019
[Hyeon] Well, you see,

547
00:38:11,102 --> 00:38:13,646
if you leave too early,
it may be seen as discourteous.

548
00:38:13,730 --> 00:38:17,233
If too late, the other members
of the royal family will grow jealous.

549
00:38:17,317 --> 00:38:20,486
[chuckles] I'd appreciate it if you
kept these things in mind.

550
00:38:37,420 --> 00:38:39,297
Please forgive the delayed greetings.

551
00:38:40,632 --> 00:38:41,633
Father.

552
00:38:44,177 --> 00:38:47,889
[clears throat] Well,
we are very honored to host you,

553
00:38:47,972 --> 00:38:49,766
Your Royal Highness.

554
00:38:50,350 --> 00:38:53,144
My dear younger sister is not perforated.
I mean, not perfect.

555
00:38:53,227 --> 00:38:55,939
We hope she does not prove an impediment.

556
00:38:56,689 --> 00:38:57,815
-And…
-[clears throat]

557
00:38:59,817 --> 00:39:01,319
I, Hyeonguk of the Seong Family,

558
00:39:01,945 --> 00:39:03,947
offer you my greetings,
Your Royal Highness.

559
00:39:08,451 --> 00:39:09,661
This is my son.

560
00:39:09,744 --> 00:39:11,996
I'm the Senior Managing Director
of Castle Group

561
00:39:12,080 --> 00:39:13,831
and his soon-to-be successor…

562
00:39:15,166 --> 00:39:16,209
Yes, right.

563
00:39:16,960 --> 00:39:19,087
I remember, Brother.

564
00:39:20,713 --> 00:39:22,715
[chuckles] Yes, I see.

565
00:39:22,799 --> 00:39:24,592
Uh… [chuckles]

566
00:39:24,676 --> 00:39:25,885
"Brother"? Insane.

567
00:39:25,969 --> 00:39:27,679
You mean, "Your Royal Highness."

568
00:39:28,262 --> 00:39:33,184
[chuckles] Yes, right. He already… Yeah.

569
00:39:33,267 --> 00:39:35,395
[both chuckle]

570
00:39:37,480 --> 00:39:38,481
[sighs]
STYLE
::cue()

571
00:39:44,153 --> 00:39:46,739
I mean, I know it's just an…

572
00:39:49,075 --> 00:39:50,410
just an act and all,

573
00:39:50,493 --> 00:39:52,787
but they're so stiff
around each other, aren't they?

574
00:39:52,870 --> 00:39:54,956
I'm so scared they're going to get caught.

575
00:39:55,039 --> 00:39:56,290
I hear you.

576
00:39:56,374 --> 00:39:59,585
I heard it was super awkward
during the health assessment yesterday.

577
00:39:59,669 --> 00:40:02,088
I mean, can you imagine
how tense she must've been?

578
00:40:02,171 --> 00:40:05,216
To make her heart pound like that?

579
00:40:05,299 --> 00:40:06,342
But…

580
00:40:07,552 --> 00:40:09,679
-Don't you think it's excessive?
-My thoughts exactly.

581
00:40:09,762 --> 00:40:11,973
-Maybe they're falling for each other.
-What?

582
00:40:12,056 --> 00:40:14,892
I mean, they actually look like
they just started dating.

583
00:40:16,144 --> 00:40:17,311
Just started dating…

584
00:40:18,354 --> 00:40:19,564
Oh?

585
00:40:19,647 --> 00:40:21,357
[phone chimes]

586
00:40:22,859 --> 00:40:24,694
[gasps] I need to go.

587
00:40:24,777 --> 00:40:25,945
I'll come with you.

588
00:40:26,446 --> 00:40:29,073
No, you should finish all this first.

589
00:40:30,324 --> 00:40:31,325
I'm off.

590
00:40:32,160 --> 00:40:33,745
Okay. See you later.

591
00:40:36,998 --> 00:40:38,291
[sighs]

592
00:40:46,799 --> 00:40:49,802
[♪ romantic music plays]

593
00:41:08,154 --> 00:41:09,405
[Taeju] Yes, thanks.

594
00:41:10,114 --> 00:41:11,866
[clears throat] Thank you.

595
00:41:11,949 --> 00:41:14,494
I'm actually the CEO
of Castle Hotel as well.

596
00:41:14,577 --> 00:41:17,705
I had some of our chefs come by
to cook this. How is it?

597
00:41:17,789 --> 00:41:19,791
You're not the CEO yet.

598
00:41:19,874 --> 00:41:21,918
That handover hasn't happened yet.

599
00:41:22,001 --> 00:41:23,461
Must you bring that up now?

600
00:41:24,003 --> 00:41:26,005
[stammers] It's almost done.

601
00:41:27,298 --> 00:41:29,175
It's all very good, Brother.

602
00:41:29,258 --> 00:41:30,510
Oh… [chuckles]

603
00:41:30,593 --> 00:41:31,594
Is it?

604
00:41:32,136 --> 00:41:34,222
I'm so glad.

605
00:41:34,305 --> 00:41:39,143
[inhales sharply]
Can I ask when you two started dating?

606
00:41:40,269 --> 00:41:41,270
-Pardon?
-Well, you see,

607
00:41:41,354 --> 00:41:43,898
she used to have terrible taste in men.

608
00:41:43,981 --> 00:41:46,651
What do they call it?
You know, the ones you carry around.

609
00:41:46,734 --> 00:41:48,861
Who cares about that now?

610
00:41:48,945 --> 00:41:50,696
Oh, right. Trophy boys.

611
00:41:50,780 --> 00:41:53,991
She used to be really into trophy boys.
They were always so skinny.

612
00:41:54,075 --> 00:41:56,285
But somehow, she landed
a really solid husband.

613
00:41:56,369 --> 00:41:58,329
-[smacks table]
-Seong…

614
00:41:58,955 --> 00:41:59,956
Dear brother.

615
00:42:01,249 --> 00:42:03,042
Relax. It's a compliment.

616
00:42:03,126 --> 00:42:04,418
Just look at Our Royal Highness.

617
00:42:04,502 --> 00:42:07,547
He's so tall. Almost as tall
as the doorframe. And his shoulders…

618
00:42:07,630 --> 00:42:09,632
Yeah, they're almost
as broad as this table.

619
00:42:09,715 --> 00:42:12,260
-That's a real man for you…
-[chuckles]

620
00:42:12,343 --> 00:42:16,514
He's just trying to say
that you make a really nice couple.

621
00:42:16,597 --> 00:42:17,723
Yeah, that's right.

622
00:42:18,349 --> 00:42:19,684
-Stop drinking.
-Okay.

623
00:42:20,852 --> 00:42:23,146
-Yeah, a nice couple. Mmm…
-[sighs]

624
00:42:23,229 --> 00:42:24,814
[Hyeonguk] Please…

625
00:42:25,898 --> 00:42:27,441
cherish her.

626
00:42:31,279 --> 00:42:33,865
She spent her whole life
thinking highly of herself,

627
00:42:33,948 --> 00:42:34,949
so I had hoped

628
00:42:36,409 --> 00:42:38,369
she'd end up with someone
a bit beneath her.

629
00:42:38,452 --> 00:42:41,539
I cannot help but be concerned
about her marrying into the royal family.

630
00:42:41,622 --> 00:42:44,125
I will do my best to make sure
you have nothing to worry--

631
00:42:44,208 --> 00:42:46,419
If that was all it took,
I would not worry.

632
00:42:47,378 --> 00:42:50,089
[♪ tense music plays]

633
00:42:54,510 --> 00:42:55,511
That place is known

634
00:42:56,304 --> 00:42:58,806
for its troubles and tragedies, is it not?

635
00:43:07,398 --> 00:43:09,442
[chuckles]

636
00:43:11,694 --> 00:43:12,695
That doesn't

637
00:43:13,321 --> 00:43:14,322
quite hold up, does it?

638
00:43:16,324 --> 00:43:17,909
Who are you trying to kid?

639
00:43:20,161 --> 00:43:22,163
Am I wrong? [sighs]

640
00:43:22,246 --> 00:43:24,582
Where was that ever-worried father

641
00:43:24,665 --> 00:43:27,752
when I got into that car accident?

642
00:43:29,629 --> 00:43:31,214
It just doesn't add up, does it?

643
00:43:32,840 --> 00:43:35,635
As you can see, she is still a child.

644
00:43:36,969 --> 00:43:38,638
-She has her shortcomings--
-[smacks table]

645
00:43:38,721 --> 00:43:40,723
That's enough small talk, isn't it?

646
00:43:41,432 --> 00:43:43,226
Don't you have a wedding gift for us?

647
00:43:43,935 --> 00:43:45,645
I mean, when Taeju got married,

648
00:43:46,312 --> 00:43:49,482
you gave Dayeong's family
company shares and even a building.

649
00:43:49,565 --> 00:43:50,775
All on a silver platter.
STYLE
::cue()

650
00:43:53,903 --> 00:43:56,405
[coughs]

651
00:43:57,114 --> 00:43:59,200
Your one and only daughter
is getting married.

652
00:44:00,368 --> 00:44:01,911
Surely, you must have something.

653
00:44:03,955 --> 00:44:04,997
How about

654
00:44:06,040 --> 00:44:07,875
a generous donation to the crown?

655
00:44:07,959 --> 00:44:09,043
[Taeju] Hey.

656
00:44:09,627 --> 00:44:11,545
You're making
His Royal Highness uncomfortable.

657
00:44:12,797 --> 00:44:13,798
[sighs]

658
00:44:15,299 --> 00:44:18,261
You can finish this meal without me.

659
00:44:18,344 --> 00:44:20,221
I thought I could practice restraint…

660
00:44:21,222 --> 00:44:22,723
[sucks teeth, inhales sharply]

661
00:44:22,807 --> 00:44:23,933
…but it's just too hard.

662
00:44:33,609 --> 00:44:35,069
-[sighs]
-[Taeju] Hmm…

663
00:44:39,740 --> 00:44:41,075
Let me check on her.

664
00:44:59,218 --> 00:45:00,303
[sighs]

665
00:45:08,728 --> 00:45:09,729
Seong Huiju.

666
00:45:13,232 --> 00:45:14,233
[sighs]

667
00:45:18,529 --> 00:45:21,365
[Huiju breathing slowly, deeply]

668
00:45:35,963 --> 00:45:37,465
Just let me be for a second.

669
00:45:38,299 --> 00:45:40,926
I'll come back down
once my anger subsides a bit.

670
00:45:48,100 --> 00:45:49,310
[I-AN grunts, sighs]

671
00:45:54,106 --> 00:45:55,107
What?

672
00:45:56,984 --> 00:46:00,112
Are you having second thoughts?
Because my family is such a hot mess?

673
00:46:04,033 --> 00:46:05,326
You must have a bad memory.

674
00:46:08,662 --> 00:46:10,498
If you remembered
what Queen Mother said to me,

675
00:46:11,207 --> 00:46:12,625
there's no way you'd say that.

676
00:46:17,046 --> 00:46:18,047
That's true.

677
00:46:21,175 --> 00:46:23,803
Doesn't it seem like your father likes me?

678
00:46:27,390 --> 00:46:29,225
-You believed that?
-Should I not?

679
00:46:29,850 --> 00:46:32,728
That doting, concerned father bit
is all an act.

680
00:46:33,604 --> 00:46:36,357
The result of him running
the numbers and sizing up

681
00:46:37,274 --> 00:46:38,943
what he could gain by using you.

682
00:46:51,288 --> 00:46:52,289
Who cares?

683
00:46:53,457 --> 00:46:54,542
As long as I'm genuine.

684
00:46:55,751 --> 00:46:58,421
[♪ tender song playing]

685
00:46:58,504 --> 00:47:00,464
I have a great deal that you do not,

686
00:47:01,340 --> 00:47:02,550
and if you ask for it,

687
00:47:03,968 --> 00:47:05,553
I fully intend to provide it.

688
00:47:20,818 --> 00:47:21,819
By chance,

689
00:47:23,487 --> 00:47:25,156
do you have feelings for me?

690
00:47:26,866 --> 00:47:29,243
-All of a sudden?
-Then was I

691
00:47:30,327 --> 00:47:33,247
your first… or something?

692
00:47:34,331 --> 00:47:35,416
What?

693
00:47:35,499 --> 00:47:37,084
I mean… [sucks teeth]

694
00:47:38,169 --> 00:47:42,006
It's true. I can be quite a femme fatale.

695
00:47:43,674 --> 00:47:44,884
But still,

696
00:47:46,343 --> 00:47:48,304
your eyes are sparkling a little too much.

697
00:47:55,728 --> 00:47:56,854
[scoffs]

698
00:47:57,480 --> 00:47:58,731
[laughs]

699
00:48:04,695 --> 00:48:05,821
I do like you.
STYLE
::cue()

700
00:48:07,323 --> 00:48:08,449
And it's my first time.

701
00:48:13,579 --> 00:48:15,372
Restraint always followed desire.

702
00:48:17,791 --> 00:48:19,084
But it's not easy this time.

703
00:48:24,548 --> 00:48:26,759
What? Having second thoughts?

704
00:48:28,344 --> 00:48:29,929
Worried I won't divorce you?

705
00:48:32,932 --> 00:48:33,933
You won't?

706
00:48:39,772 --> 00:48:40,773
Don't worry.

707
00:48:42,066 --> 00:48:43,776
I don't want to keep you bound to me.

708
00:48:48,906 --> 00:48:50,324
You should just accept it all.

709
00:48:51,909 --> 00:48:53,452
Whether it be money, honor,

710
00:48:55,162 --> 00:48:56,247
or my heart…

711
00:48:56,330 --> 00:48:58,249
[♪ song continuing]

712
00:49:12,137 --> 00:49:14,056
I've always had more money than you.

713
00:49:15,432 --> 00:49:16,475
Always?

714
00:49:16,559 --> 00:49:17,977
Always have.

715
00:49:18,060 --> 00:49:19,311
-"Always have"?
-Always will.

716
00:49:21,605 --> 00:49:23,107
[chuckles]

717
00:49:39,957 --> 00:49:41,959
[♪ song continuing]

718
00:50:14,199 --> 00:50:16,160
[phone buzzing]

719
00:50:20,497 --> 00:50:21,874
JEONGWOO

720
00:50:25,669 --> 00:50:26,754
What? Pick it up.

721
00:50:32,926 --> 00:50:34,261
Hey, Jeongwoo.

722
00:50:35,054 --> 00:50:37,890
Yeah, it's over. We're heading back
to the private residence.

723
00:50:40,309 --> 00:50:42,561
Yeah, he's right next to me.

724
00:50:43,187 --> 00:50:44,438
Sure. Hold on.

725
00:50:48,942 --> 00:50:50,986
[Jeongwoo] Your Royal Highness,
did it go well?

726
00:50:51,070 --> 00:50:52,196
Yeah.

727
00:50:52,279 --> 00:50:54,657
My father-in-law loves me.

728
00:50:54,740 --> 00:50:56,408
Really? [chuckles]

729
00:50:57,201 --> 00:50:58,911
I guess you didn't fight
with your father today.

730
00:50:58,994 --> 00:51:01,705
Do you think I just go around
starting fights everywhere?

731
00:51:01,789 --> 00:51:03,040
[Jeongwoo chuckles]

732
00:51:03,123 --> 00:51:04,875
And Taeju? Did he behave?

733
00:51:09,713 --> 00:51:10,714
He was whatever.

734
00:51:11,715 --> 00:51:15,344
I still can't tell if handing over
the reins to him was a good idea.

735
00:51:17,012 --> 00:51:18,055
Yeah. [chuckles]

736
00:51:19,973 --> 00:51:21,058
I know, right?

737
00:51:22,434 --> 00:51:24,478
What about you? Are you done with work?

738
00:51:34,613 --> 00:51:36,073
I'll see you on our wedding day.

739
00:51:42,121 --> 00:51:43,330
I'm sad about leaving too.

740
00:51:54,675 --> 00:51:55,884
[car door opens]

741
00:52:00,055 --> 00:52:01,223
[car door shuts]

742
00:52:08,439 --> 00:52:09,773
[chuckles]
STYLE
::cue()

743
00:52:15,446 --> 00:52:16,613
How did it go?

744
00:52:16,697 --> 00:52:17,906
Did the chairman like him?

745
00:52:17,990 --> 00:52:22,578
-Of course, he did. How could he not?
-Earlier, His Royal Highness was like,

746
00:52:22,661 --> 00:52:23,787
"I'm sad about leaving too."

747
00:52:24,955 --> 00:52:26,832
-He said that before he left.
-[giggling]

748
00:52:26,915 --> 00:52:28,709
Was His Royal Highness nervous?
Did he do well?

749
00:52:28,792 --> 00:52:31,003
Have you been waiting for me
to ask about that?

750
00:52:31,670 --> 00:52:33,505
-Yes.
-They couldn't even eat.

751
00:52:33,589 --> 00:52:34,757
They were all so nervous.

752
00:52:34,840 --> 00:52:36,842
-Still?
-Yes.

753
00:52:36,925 --> 00:52:38,302
[sighs, scoffs]

754
00:52:38,385 --> 00:52:40,345
I know it's late,

755
00:52:41,346 --> 00:52:42,347
but should we grab a bite?

756
00:52:42,431 --> 00:52:44,308
-Yes.
-Yes please!

757
00:52:44,391 --> 00:52:45,851
What about that new place?

758
00:52:45,934 --> 00:52:48,103
You said that place was delicious.

759
00:52:48,187 --> 00:52:50,397
-Where is this place?
-Yeah, we should go there.

760
00:52:55,527 --> 00:52:56,862
[server] Enjoy.

761
00:52:56,945 --> 00:52:59,406
Thank you. All right, then.

762
00:52:59,490 --> 00:53:00,908
Eat up now.

763
00:53:00,991 --> 00:53:02,743
It'll all be

764
00:53:03,410 --> 00:53:04,661
my treat tonight.

765
00:53:04,745 --> 00:53:07,247
-Thank you.
-Thank you so much.

766
00:53:09,333 --> 00:53:11,001
[exclaims]

767
00:53:11,084 --> 00:53:12,419
Mmm!

768
00:53:12,503 --> 00:53:14,004
-It's so good.
-[chuckles]

769
00:53:14,087 --> 00:53:15,964
Your Ladyship, you should have some too.

770
00:53:16,048 --> 00:53:17,049
Poor thing.

771
00:53:17,132 --> 00:53:19,676
You must've been too nervous to eat.

772
00:53:21,136 --> 00:53:24,097
You must be a ball of nerves
with the wedding approaching.

773
00:53:24,181 --> 00:53:28,352
Come on, a lot of people go on diets
before their wedding.

774
00:53:28,435 --> 00:53:29,520
As if.

775
00:53:29,603 --> 00:53:33,398
She's already light as a feather.
Why would she go on a diet?

776
00:53:33,482 --> 00:53:37,277
[groans] I'm taking
a night off from that diet.

777
00:53:37,361 --> 00:53:38,403
-Eat up.
-Excellent.

778
00:53:40,823 --> 00:53:41,824
Mmm…

779
00:53:42,533 --> 00:53:43,534
Mmm!

780
00:53:43,617 --> 00:53:47,579
We've been meaning to throw you
a little bridal shower.

781
00:53:47,663 --> 00:53:49,498
Maybe we can pick up a cake later?

782
00:53:49,581 --> 00:53:52,251
[Yeongmun] Her Ladyship must be tired.
Just eat up.

783
00:53:55,295 --> 00:53:56,672
Areum, why aren't you eating?

784
00:53:56,755 --> 00:53:58,632
I thought you liked this place.

785
00:53:58,715 --> 00:54:01,802
Ah… I'm just taking my time.
You should eat up too.

786
00:54:03,887 --> 00:54:05,305
-Hmm…
-Here, eat this.

787
00:54:08,100 --> 00:54:09,184
It's good.

788
00:54:10,102 --> 00:54:12,104
[♪ dramatic music plays]

789
00:54:22,364 --> 00:54:24,199
This is the Treasury's revised proposal.

790
00:54:24,283 --> 00:54:25,826
Please take a look.

791
00:54:28,036 --> 00:54:29,121
[phone rings]

792
00:54:30,956 --> 00:54:33,458
[assistant] Sir,
His Royal Highness is here for you.

793
00:54:35,377 --> 00:54:36,712
He is?

794
00:54:36,795 --> 00:54:38,380
It's not on your schedule.

795
00:54:47,764 --> 00:54:48,765
You busy?

796
00:54:59,568 --> 00:55:00,652
Can I get you anything?

797
00:55:02,696 --> 00:55:03,905
I like Seong Huiju.

798
00:55:07,451 --> 00:55:08,827
I thought you should know.

799
00:55:11,246 --> 00:55:12,623
[scoffs]

800
00:55:15,125 --> 00:55:16,209
And does my knowing that

801
00:55:16,877 --> 00:55:17,878
change anything?

802
00:55:19,129 --> 00:55:20,172
It'll make sure

803
00:55:21,632 --> 00:55:22,966
you mind your conduct.

804
00:55:32,225 --> 00:55:33,560
[chuckles]

805
00:55:35,479 --> 00:55:37,606
Does Huiju know too?
STYLE
::cue()

806
00:55:42,110 --> 00:55:43,987
I'm talking about myself right now.

807
00:55:45,238 --> 00:55:46,281
Not her.

808
00:55:46,823 --> 00:55:48,075
Don't make…

809
00:55:50,285 --> 00:55:51,745
things difficult for Huiju.

810
00:55:52,829 --> 00:55:53,830
What?

811
00:55:53,914 --> 00:55:55,499
That's not

812
00:55:56,875 --> 00:55:58,085
what she wants from you.

813
00:56:14,851 --> 00:56:15,852
Where's Seong Huiju?

814
00:56:15,936 --> 00:56:18,397
Ah… She went into a board meeting
two hours ago.

815
00:56:18,480 --> 00:56:19,898
She should be done by now.

816
00:56:21,400 --> 00:56:22,776
She's probably in transit now.

817
00:56:22,859 --> 00:56:25,570
She said she was visiting an affiliate
right after the meeting.

818
00:56:26,530 --> 00:56:29,324
-[sighs] She'll have no time to eat.
-Exactly.

819
00:56:29,408 --> 00:56:32,160
Her shares and duties must be transferred
before the wedding.

820
00:56:32,244 --> 00:56:34,371
She has so much on her plate.

821
00:56:34,454 --> 00:56:37,416
Meaning poor Ms. Do
must also be suffering…

822
00:56:40,043 --> 00:56:41,253
Thanks for your hard work.

823
00:56:47,467 --> 00:56:49,428
DON'T FORGET TO EAT…

824
00:56:55,851 --> 00:56:56,852
[chuckles]

825
00:56:58,270 --> 00:56:59,938
She's everywhere.

826
00:57:04,484 --> 00:57:07,112
-Why are they taking that down?
-Pardon?

827
00:57:07,195 --> 00:57:09,239
Oh, that? It needs to be taken down now.

828
00:57:09,322 --> 00:57:11,700
Her Royal Highness cannot engage
in personal promotion.

829
00:57:14,494 --> 00:57:15,579
[sighs]

830
00:57:20,041 --> 00:57:22,627
[I-AN] Don't forget to eat
just because you're busy.

831
00:57:22,711 --> 00:57:25,839
Why'd you pull that ad already?
Make money while you still can.

832
00:57:27,507 --> 00:57:28,967
-[Hyejeong] Ms. Seong.
-What?

833
00:57:33,972 --> 00:57:35,307
-Continue.
-Yes, ma'am.

834
00:57:35,932 --> 00:57:37,768
Next, we are developing plans

835
00:57:37,851 --> 00:57:40,061
for local marketing campaigns
and influencer partnerships,

836
00:57:40,145 --> 00:57:42,731
along with a training program
for the new product launch.

837
00:57:42,814 --> 00:57:45,150
We're in the final review stage
of the contracts.

838
00:57:46,151 --> 00:57:48,320
Okay. Sounds good.

839
00:57:48,403 --> 00:57:49,404
[giggles]

840
00:57:50,989 --> 00:57:53,700
[♪ whimsical music plays]

841
00:57:59,414 --> 00:58:00,415
Your Royal Highness.

842
00:58:01,416 --> 00:58:04,085
The ceremonial robe has arrived
from the Royal Tailor Institution.

843
00:58:21,269 --> 00:58:22,604
Are you that delighted?

844
00:58:25,315 --> 00:58:26,358
No.

845
00:58:27,275 --> 00:58:28,985
[clears throat]

846
00:58:29,069 --> 00:58:30,695
-Where's Huiju?
-Ms. Seong is--

847
00:58:30,779 --> 00:58:31,822
Your Royal Highness.

848
00:58:32,489 --> 00:58:35,617
You must now observe
the proper forms of address.

849
00:58:37,369 --> 00:58:38,370
[clears throat]

850
00:58:39,830 --> 00:58:42,582
Where… is my wife?

851
00:58:46,711 --> 00:58:47,879
What is she doing?

852
00:58:58,056 --> 00:59:01,560
Your Ladyship!
STYLE
::cue()

853
00:59:06,690 --> 00:59:07,691
[Hyejeong] Right.

854
00:59:10,694 --> 00:59:11,695
Okay.

855
00:59:11,778 --> 00:59:14,281
So once you put on
that crimson ceremonial robe…

856
00:59:14,364 --> 00:59:17,701
-Crimson?
-Your eyeliner will smudge.

857
00:59:18,869 --> 00:59:22,122
I finally get to wear red
and walk into the palace?

858
00:59:22,205 --> 00:59:23,915
Here. The Ministry of Rites…

859
00:59:23,999 --> 00:59:25,250
[Dayeong] Huiju!

860
00:59:26,209 --> 00:59:27,460
My goodness.

861
00:59:27,961 --> 00:59:30,964
Why are you here so early?

862
00:59:31,840 --> 00:59:36,511
You and your assistant have little regard
for court or noble etiquette.

863
00:59:36,595 --> 00:59:39,639
As a lady of a noble house,
I'll have to review everything myself.

864
00:59:41,224 --> 00:59:42,225
[sighs]

865
00:59:49,941 --> 00:59:51,818
Mmm… Not bad.

866
00:59:54,362 --> 00:59:57,198
-Have her wedding shoes arrived?
-Yes, they have!

867
01:00:04,664 --> 01:00:06,374
-My goodness!
-Oh, my!

868
01:00:06,458 --> 01:00:08,919
[giggles] This is how
you protect your heels.

869
01:00:09,002 --> 01:00:10,754
You'll be wearing them all day.

870
01:00:10,837 --> 01:00:13,006
I see. That makes sense.

871
01:00:13,632 --> 01:00:15,342
-[phone buzzes]
-Hmm?

872
01:00:18,219 --> 01:00:19,220
Hey, Jeongwoo.

873
01:00:19,804 --> 01:00:21,056
Are preparations going well?

874
01:00:21,640 --> 01:00:23,183
You sure you don't want to call it off?

875
01:00:23,266 --> 01:00:24,267
[scoffs]

876
01:00:24,351 --> 01:00:26,895
-And if I say I do, would you help me?
-[chuckles]

877
01:00:30,857 --> 01:00:31,858
Prime Minister Min.

878
01:00:33,485 --> 01:00:34,486
I'll call you back.

879
01:00:43,703 --> 01:00:45,538
Are you still not dressed?

880
01:00:47,415 --> 01:00:49,167
Are you all right?

881
01:00:51,628 --> 01:00:53,588
Why would I not be?

882
01:00:56,716 --> 01:00:57,717
Then…

883
01:00:59,761 --> 01:01:00,929
I shall wait.

884
01:01:05,684 --> 01:01:08,311
Until the day you can
no longer restrain yourself.

885
01:01:22,492 --> 01:01:24,661
Do we just wait here?

886
01:01:25,328 --> 01:01:28,331
[♪ elegant music plays]

887
01:01:35,964 --> 01:01:37,340
[gasps]

888
01:01:37,424 --> 01:01:39,342
Huiju looks so pretty.

889
01:01:40,969 --> 01:01:42,512
No, you're way prettier.

890
01:01:53,648 --> 01:01:55,775
Congratulations on your nuptials.

891
01:01:55,859 --> 01:01:57,736
-Congratulations.
-Congratulations.

892
01:02:05,285 --> 01:02:06,995
[inhales sharply]

893
01:02:07,078 --> 01:02:10,290
You're officially
the Grand Prince's wife. [giggles]

894
01:02:10,373 --> 01:02:12,459
So? You like it?

895
01:02:15,378 --> 01:02:16,463
[sighs]
STYLE
::cue()

896
01:02:22,802 --> 01:02:24,220
[♪ traditional Korean music plays]

897
01:02:24,304 --> 01:02:25,889
[officiant] All bow deeply!

898
01:02:47,160 --> 01:02:48,369
All rise!

899
01:02:59,589 --> 01:03:01,466
-[grunts]
-[gasps]

900
01:03:01,549 --> 01:03:02,967
-You're okay.
-Your Ladyship.

901
01:03:03,051 --> 01:03:04,052
Damn it…

902
01:03:04,761 --> 01:03:06,179
[chuckles]

903
01:03:10,433 --> 01:03:14,771
The bride and groom
shall exchange deep bows.

904
01:03:15,480 --> 01:03:17,732
[♪ light orchestral music playing]

905
01:03:18,817 --> 01:03:21,152
By sharing this wine,

906
01:03:21,694 --> 01:03:23,905
you are now equals in status and soul.

907
01:03:25,490 --> 01:03:29,577
I proclaim to Heaven and Earth
that you are joined as husband and wife.

908
01:03:32,372 --> 01:03:34,499
[coughs]

909
01:03:36,251 --> 01:03:37,335
Are you all right?

910
01:03:38,002 --> 01:03:39,129
[coughs]

911
01:03:39,212 --> 01:03:40,213
[strained] I'm fine.

912
01:03:40,797 --> 01:03:41,798
[chuckles]

913
01:03:42,632 --> 01:03:47,804
The father of the bride
shall now offer words of caution.

914
01:03:50,390 --> 01:03:52,183
Show caution and reverence.

915
01:03:52,267 --> 01:03:54,686
From early dawn until late at night,

916
01:03:54,769 --> 01:03:56,980
let there be no deviation from command.

917
01:03:58,398 --> 01:03:59,399
Yes.

918
01:04:00,024 --> 01:04:01,943
I shall carry out your command faithfully.

919
01:04:03,653 --> 01:04:04,696
Do not look down.

920
01:04:05,530 --> 01:04:06,573
It makes you look weak.

921
01:04:29,929 --> 01:04:32,432
-[cheering]
-[♪ marching music plays]

922
01:05:04,422 --> 01:05:06,257
My goodness! Her Ladyship looks so…

923
01:05:06,341 --> 01:05:08,968
No, I mean, Her Royal Highness. [giggles]

924
01:05:09,052 --> 01:05:11,012
Her lips must be on the verge of spasming.

925
01:05:11,095 --> 01:05:12,555
Just look at that perfect makeup.

926
01:05:12,639 --> 01:05:15,058
Aren't you glad I used pink coral
instead of coral pink?

927
01:05:15,141 --> 01:05:16,142
[Youngseon] Totally.

928
01:05:16,226 --> 01:05:18,645
Just look at that massive crowd.

929
01:05:18,728 --> 01:05:20,939
I don't think it was that big
for the Queen Mother.

930
01:05:21,022 --> 01:05:22,315
Definitely not.

931
01:05:23,274 --> 01:05:26,861
[coughs] Gosh. Why am I tearing up?

932
01:05:26,945 --> 01:05:29,447
You look like your son's getting married.

933
01:05:30,907 --> 01:05:33,326
Steward Kim, are you crying?

934
01:05:33,409 --> 01:05:34,535
[inhales sharply]

935
01:05:35,119 --> 01:05:36,704
[sighs]

936
01:05:36,788 --> 01:05:39,499
Our Royal Highness is all grown up now.

937
01:05:40,541 --> 01:05:42,210
-Hey, we crushed that.
-Gosh.

938
01:05:42,293 --> 01:05:43,419
We crushed it!

939
01:05:55,807 --> 01:05:56,933
Smile.

940
01:05:57,016 --> 01:05:59,936
My jaw is about to snap
from all this smiling.

941
01:06:01,354 --> 01:06:04,315
How do you do this for every single event?

942
01:06:05,525 --> 01:06:06,567
Just hang in there.
STYLE
::cue()

943
01:06:08,069 --> 01:06:09,070
We're almost there.

944
01:06:25,545 --> 01:06:27,880
THE MARRIAGE PROCESSION OF
GRAND PRINCE I-AN

945
01:06:27,964 --> 01:06:29,799
AND GRAND PRINCESS SEONG

946
01:06:29,882 --> 01:06:32,885
[♪ melancholic music plays]

947
01:06:51,696 --> 01:06:54,115
That is why I told you to veto it.

948
01:06:56,326 --> 01:06:57,785
What is long suppressed

949
01:06:59,120 --> 01:07:01,122
tends to erupt
in the most unexpected ways.

950
01:07:06,878 --> 01:07:08,880
[camera shutters clicking]

951
01:07:21,351 --> 01:07:22,810
-Congratulations.
-Congratulations.

952
01:07:22,894 --> 01:07:24,729
-Congratulations.
-Congratulations.

953
01:07:30,360 --> 01:07:32,070
The most sincere congratulations

954
01:07:32,153 --> 01:07:35,073
to His Royal Highness
and Her Royal Highness.

955
01:07:40,953 --> 01:07:42,455
Congratulations on achieving

956
01:07:43,039 --> 01:07:44,040
nominal status.

957
01:07:48,044 --> 01:07:49,045
[scoffs]

958
01:07:51,881 --> 01:07:53,966
[♪ romantic music plays]

959
01:08:06,813 --> 01:08:08,439
[Court Lady Choi] Your Majesty.

960
01:08:08,523 --> 01:08:10,858
The Grand Prince
and his wife have arrived.

961
01:09:19,677 --> 01:09:21,179
[Jeongwoo] Grand Prince I-AN.

962
01:09:21,762 --> 01:09:24,307
On behalf of the people and the Cabinet,

963
01:09:25,016 --> 01:09:27,643
I offer my most sincere congratulations
on your union.

964
01:09:28,769 --> 01:09:30,897
-Congratulations.
-Congratulations.

965
01:09:31,481 --> 01:09:32,899
Thank you, Prime Minister.

966
01:09:35,026 --> 01:09:36,360
[sighs]

967
01:09:37,695 --> 01:09:38,821
[Jeongwoo] Your Royal Highness.

968
01:09:39,614 --> 01:09:41,365
On behalf of the people and the Cabinet,

969
01:09:42,116 --> 01:09:43,159
I offer

970
01:09:44,035 --> 01:09:45,578
my most sincere congratulations…
STYLE
::cue()

971
01:09:52,293 --> 01:09:53,377
on your union.

972
01:09:56,422 --> 01:09:58,090
-Congratulations.
-Congratulations.

973
01:09:58,883 --> 01:10:00,301
Thank… [coughs]

974
01:10:02,136 --> 01:10:04,138
[coughing]

975
01:10:06,349 --> 01:10:07,475
Seong Huiju.

976
01:10:08,142 --> 01:10:09,977
[♪ tense music plays]

977
01:10:14,023 --> 01:10:15,024
Seong Huiju.

978
01:10:28,037 --> 01:10:30,581
-[exhales sharply]
-[clamoring]

979
01:10:31,791 --> 01:10:32,834
Seong Huiju!

980
01:10:33,584 --> 01:10:34,669
Huiju.

981
01:10:40,341 --> 01:10:42,552
Huiju. Seong Huiju.

982
01:10:46,264 --> 01:10:47,598
Seong Huiju!

983
01:10:57,024 --> 01:10:59,944
PERFECT CROWN

984
01:11:36,063 --> 01:11:38,399
[Huiju] Toxicity? Me?

985
01:11:38,482 --> 01:11:40,067
[Jeongwoo] It looks deliberate.

986
01:11:40,776 --> 01:11:43,154
I knew you would fail to protect her.

987
01:11:43,237 --> 01:11:44,739
[Huiju] I made a mistake.

988
01:11:44,822 --> 01:11:46,365
What are you doing? Calm down!

989
01:11:46,449 --> 01:11:48,743
He's in danger right now!

990
01:11:48,826 --> 01:11:50,828
[I-AN] Was I being too greedy again?

991
01:11:52,163 --> 01:11:53,706
You're okay, right?

992
01:11:53,789 --> 01:11:55,041
I thought you were dying.

993
01:11:55,708 --> 01:11:57,043
I thought I lost you.

994
01:11:57,543 --> 01:11:59,045
What are you doing?

995
01:11:59,128 --> 01:12:01,881
The whole country saw me collapse live.

996
01:12:01,964 --> 01:12:04,050
I can't be this pretty
when I'm discharged.

997
01:12:04,884 --> 01:12:07,094
[I-AN] It's our first night
as a married couple.

998
01:12:07,720 --> 01:12:08,763
Are you ready?

999
01:12:14,393 --> 01:12:15,937
EPILOGUE

1000
01:12:16,020 --> 01:12:17,021
Don't make…

1001
01:12:19,357 --> 01:12:20,858
things difficult for Huiju.

1002
01:12:21,943 --> 01:12:22,944
What?

1003
01:12:23,027 --> 01:12:24,654
That's not

1004
01:12:25,988 --> 01:12:27,114
what she wants from you.

1005
01:12:37,333 --> 01:12:38,376
[sighs]

1006
01:12:39,001 --> 01:12:40,378
Then why wasn't it you?

1007
01:12:43,881 --> 01:12:46,008
What she aims to gain through marrying me.

1008
01:12:47,385 --> 01:12:48,761
You could provide the same.

1009
01:12:55,059 --> 01:12:56,644
Perhaps I have something

1010
01:12:57,770 --> 01:12:58,813
she wants

1011
01:13:00,398 --> 01:13:01,399
that you don't have?

1012
01:13:15,496 --> 01:13:17,498
Translated by Justin S. Kim

1013
01:13:28,801 --> 01:13:32,513
PERFECT CROWN

